00:11:16.293 --> 00:11:18.456
For a lot of people, they'd be like

00:11:18.456 --> 00:11:20.342
oh I've got to do this stupid
interview, you know whatever,

00:11:20.342 --> 00:11:21.663
they hate it, right?

00:11:21.663 --> 00:11:22.795
It won't be a great interview.

00:11:22.795 --> 00:11:24.362
I love this, I got get
jazzed up from this, right?

00:11:24.362 --> 00:11:26.104
I'm leaving this on a high, right?

00:11:26.104 --> 00:11:30.167
I love it and so too many
people are just addicted

00:11:30.167 --> 00:11:34.334
to the outcome, where you
have to enjoy the process.

00:11:35.261 --> 00:11:38.773
You've got to enjoy the work,
so if I do it doesn't work,

00:11:38.773 --> 00:11:42.387
okay, keep doing it, you do it to do it,

00:11:42.387 --> 00:11:44.651
you do it because you love doing it

00:11:44.651 --> 00:11:46.160
and you'll figure out
a way to make it work,

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.930
not just chasing the
work and then whatever

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.020
I have to do that to make it work, right?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.212
You'll never get there.

00:11:52.212 --> 00:11:53.561
The people who've had success in any field

00:11:53.561 --> 00:11:57.175
entrepreneurship or
career, anything, they love

00:11:57.175 --> 00:12:00.861
the business, they love
getting up and doing the work.

00:12:00.861 --> 00:12:03.335
They may not love every
day or every part of it,

00:12:03.335 --> 00:12:06.782
it's not all roses, but they like the work

00:12:06.782 --> 00:12:08.712
and when other people
looking their schedule

00:12:08.712 --> 00:12:10.545
it looks like torture.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.410
(dramatic music)

